{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50739","headline":"题赠崔权处士 · 张祜","name":"题赠崔权处士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"（按此诗亦见《永乐大典》卷一三四五○「二寘」「士」字「处士」条。\n〖十四函一百三十七册〗。\n）读尽儒书鬓皓然，身游城市（《大典》作「下」）意林泉。\n已因骏马成三迳，犹恨胡麻欠一廛。\n真玉比来曾不磷，直鈎从此更谁怜？\n遗民莫恨无高躅，陶令而今亦甚贤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50739.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50739","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}